7}, {"w": "a", "t": 58.72, "d": 0.16, "line": 17}, {"w": "rock", "t": 58.88, "d": 0.38, "line": 17}, {"w": "You", "t": 59.84, "d": 0.05, "line": 18}, {"w": "see", "t": 59.84, "d": 0.24, "line": 18}, {"w": "Niihau", "t": 60.66, "d": 0.34, "line": 18}, {"w": "was", "t": 61.0, "d": 0.22, "line": 18}, {"w": "never", "t": 61.22, "d": 0.38, "line": 18}, {"w": "empty", "t": 61.6, "d": 0.42, "line": 18}, {"w": "It", "t": 62.42, "d": 0.06, "line": 18}, {"w": "was", "t": 62.48, "d": 0.14, "line": 18}, {"w": "private", "t": 62.62, "d": 0.46, "line": 18}, {"w": "one", "t": 63.4, "d": 0.2, "line": 18}, {"w": "family", "t": 63.6, "d": 0.36, "line": 18}, {"w": "no", "t": 64.36, "d": 0.24, "line": 18}, {"w": "phones", "t": 64.6, "d": 0.38, "line": 18}, {"w": "no", "t": 65.34, "d": 0.18, "line": 18}, {"w": "power", "t": 65.52, "d": 0.38, "line": 18}, {"w": "one", "t": 66.32, "d": 0.24, "line": 18}, {"w": "boat", "t": 66.56, "d": 0.2, "line": 18}, {"w": "a", "t": 66.76, "d": 0.1, "line": 18}, {"w": "week", "t": 66.86, "d": 0.22, "line": 18}, {"w": "The", "t": 67.34, "d": 0.16, "line": 19}, {"w": "rancher", "t": 67.5, "d": 0.34, "line": 19}, {"w": "got", "t": 67.84, "d": 0.16, "line": 19}, {"w": "a", "t": 68.0, "d": 0.12, "line": 19}, {"w": "medal", "t": 68.12, "d": 0.2, "line": 19}, {"w": "The", "t": 68.86, "d": 0.08, "line": 19}, {"w": "submarine", "t": 68.94, "d": 0.4, "line": 19}, {"w": "never", "t": 69.34, "d": 0.32, "line": 19}, {"w": "came", "t": 69.66, "d": 0.34, "line": 19}, {"w": "And", "t": 70.28, "d": 0.14, "line": 20}, {"w": "the", "t": 70.42, "d": 0.12, "line": 20}, {"w": "plane?", "t": 70.54, "d": 0.28, "line": 20}, {"w": "Still", "t": 71.22, "d": 0.3, "line": 20}, {"w": "in", "t": 71.52, "d": 0.16, "line": 20}, {"w": "a", "t": 71.68, "d": 0.1, "line": 20}, {"w": "Hawaii", "t": 71.78, "d": 0.28, "line": 20}, {"w": "museum", "t": 72.06, "d": 0.48, "line": 20}, {"w": "a", "t": 72.92, "d": 0.18, "line": 20}, {"w": "souvenir", "t": 73.1, "d": 0.48, "line": 20}, {"w": "from", "t": 73.58, "d": 0.18, "line": 20}, {"w": "the", "t": 73.76, "d": 0.12, "line": 20}, {"w": "island", "t": 73.88, "d": 0.3, "line": 20}, {"w": "that", "t": 74.18, "d": 0.2, "line": 20}, {"w": "was", "t": 74.38, "d": 0.14, "line": 20}, {"w": "supposed", "t": 74.52, "d": 0.42, "line": 20}, {"w": "to", "t": 74.94, "d": 0.26, "line": 20}, {"w": "be", "t": 75.2, "d": 0.14, "line": 20}, {"w": "empty", "t": 75.34, "d": 0.32, "line": 20}], "lines": [{"i": 0, "text": "A Pearl Harbor pilot was told to crash on an empty island.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 3.86, "pauses_cut": 0}, {"i": 1, "text": "A hundred and thirty-six people were standing on it.", "t0": 3.96, "t1": 7.091, "pauses_cut": 0}, {"i": 2, "text": "The plan: land on tiny Niihau... and wait for a submarine.", "t0": 7.191, "t1": 11.556, "pauses_cut": 2}, {"i": 3, "text": "So he lands.", "t0": 11.656, "t1": 12.956, "pauses_cut": 0}, {"i": 4, "text": "In a fence.", "t0": 13.856, "t1": 14.875, "pauses_cut": 0}, {"i": 5, "text": "A local man pulls him out, and politely borrows his pistol and his papers.", "t0": 14.975, "t1": 19.374, "pauses_cut": 0}, {"i": 6, "text": "The pilot wants them back. No luck.", "t0": 19.474, "t1": 21.902, "pauses_cut": 1}, {"i": 7, "text": "Nobody here knows there's a war... so they throw him a party!", "t0": 22.002, "t1": 25.853, "pauses_cut": 0}, {"i": 8, "text": "That night, a battery radio delivers the news.", "t0": 26.153, "t1": 29.13, "pauses_cut": 1}, {"i": 9, "text": "The party ends quickly.", "t0": 29.23, "t1": 30.999, "pauses_cut": 0}, {"i": 10, "text": "Now he's a prisoner. And no boat can come: the military has banned them all.", "t0": 31.099, "t1": 35.488, "pauses_cut": 2}, {"i": 11, "text": "Five days later, he finds a helper... with a shotgun.", "t0": 35.788, "t1": 39.815, "pauses_cut": 2}, {"i": 12, "text": "They burn a house looking for the papers. They burn the plane.", "t0": 39.915, "t1": 43.485, "pauses_cut": 1}, {"i": 13, "text": "The village hides in caves. One rancher does not.", "t0": 43.585, "t1": 47.027, "pauses_cut": 1}, {"i": 14, "text": "He jumps the pilot. The pilot shoots him three times.", "t0": 47.127, "t1": 50.555, "pauses_cut": 1}, {"i": 15, "text": "As he told it later... that's when he got mad.", "t0": 50.655, "t1": 54.077, "pauses_cut": 1}, {"i": 16, "text": "He throws the pilot into a stone wall.", "t0": 54.177, "t1": 56.7, "pauses_cut": 0}, {"i": 17, "text": "His wife ends the argument with a rock.", "t0": 56.8, "t1": 59.445, "pauses_cut": 0}, {"i": 18, "text": "You see, Niihau was never empty. It was private: one family, no phones, no power, one boat a week.", "t0": 59.745, "t1": 67.238, "pauses_cut": 2}, {"i": 19, "text": "The rancher got a medal. The submarine never came.", "t0": 67.338, "t1": 70.17, "pauses_cut": 1}, {"i": 20, "text": "And the plane? Still in a Hawaii museum... a souvenir from the island that was supposed to be empty.", "t0": 70.27, "t1": 75.864, "pauses_cut": 2}]}